# Heartfire Immolator deals damage equal to its power as it last existed on the battlefield (CR 113.7a, 608.2h). Bot2 enchants
# it with Weakness (-2/-1), so it is 0/1, and Bot2's own spell does not trigger Bot1's prowess. Sacrificed for {R} targeting
# Bot2's Ornithopter, it deals no damage (CR 120.8): the Ornithopter has no damage marked and survives.

